sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Researcher
    participant C as Processing environment<br/>(local, HPC or cloud)
    participant RS as Yoda research space
    actor DS as Data steward
    participant V as Yoda vault
    participant DC as DataCite
    participant P as Public landing page

    rect rgba(120, 160, 220, 0.12)
    Note over R,RS: 1. Collect and upload
    R->>RS: Upload raw sensor data (folder structure)
    R->>RS: Add metadata (Delta Enigma metadata standard)
    end

    rect rgba(120, 200, 160, 0.12)
    Note over R,RS: 2. Process outside Yoda
    RS-->>R: Download raw data
    R->>C: Clean, quality-control and transform
    C-->>R: Refined, unaggregated dataset
    R->>RS: Upload refined data and processing documentation
    R->>RS: Complete metadata for the refined dataset
    end

    rect rgba(230, 180, 100, 0.12)
    Note over R,V: 3. Secure in the vault
    R->>RS: Submit folder to vault
    RS->>DS: Notify: folder submitted
    alt Data and metadata meet guidelines
        DS->>RS: Accept submission
        RS->>V: Copy data package to vault
        Note over V: Unpublished
    else Changes needed
        DS-->>R: Reject with feedback
        Note over RS: Folder unlocked for edits
    end
    end

    rect rgba(200, 130, 200, 0.12)
    Note over R,P: 4. Publish
    R->>V: Request publication (accept terms)
    Note over V: Submitted for publication
    V->>DS: Notify: publication request
    alt Approved
        DS->>V: Approve for publication
        Note over V: Approved for publication
        V->>DC: Reserve DOI and register metadata
        DC-->>V: DOI registered
        V->>P: Publish landing page and public metadata
        V->>DC: Link DOI to landing page
        Note over V: Published
        P-->>R: Dataset findable and citable via DOI
    else Rejected
        DS-->>V: Reject publication
        Note over V: Unpublished
        DS-->>R: Feedback on what to fix
    end
    end
